
# 從頭再嚟
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:由頭開始再做一次，通常用喺失敗之後，鼓勵人唔好放棄，重新開始。
eng:to start over from the beginning; to try again from scratch
<eg>
yue:今次考試唔合格唔緊要，我哋從頭再嚟，下次一定得。 (gam1 ci3 haau2 si5 m4 hap6 gaak1 m4 gan2 jiu3, ngo5 dei6 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4, haa6 ci3 jat1 ding6 dak1.)
eng:It's okay to fail this exam, let's start over from the beginning, we'll definitely make it next time.
</eg>
<eg>
yue:份計劃書寫得唔好，不如從頭再嚟過啦。 (fan6 gai3 waak6 syu1 se2 dak1 m4 hou2, bat1 jyu4 cung4 tau4 zoi3 lai4 gwo3 laa1.)
eng:The proposal isn't well written, why don't we just start over from scratch.
</eg> [end of text]


